  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Hi @ByronHsu @cctry @ShangmingCai, could one of you help coordinate this with #17845 and trigger CI for the current commit?\n\nThis implements the #34510 Step 1 NIXL Prefill bootstrap-timeout item using the current `NixlKVSender`/`CommonKVSender` structure. It reuses `_check_bootstrap_timeout()` and adds focused CPU regression tests. #17845 addresses the same gap but is based on older code and has had no updates since January.\n\nThe red checks currently shown were created while this PR was a draft; their gate log says `PR is draft. Blocking CI.`, so the test jobs did not run. The PR is now ready for review. Could an authorized maintainer add the `run-ci` label and rerun CI for commit e39388f?\n\nIf continuing #17845 is preferred, I’m happy to close this PR.",
      "created_at": "2026-08-13T06:56:23Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34688#issuecomment-5277073158",
      "id": 5277073158,
      "updated_at": "2026-08-13T06:56:23Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "ting-hong-shieh"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "Quick coordination update: #34692 was opened after the comment above and implements the same #34510 Step 1 item.\n\nThe production changes overlap: both initialize `NixlKVSender.init_time` and call `_check_bootstrap_timeout()` while the sender is in `KVPoll.Bootstrapping`. This PR also includes focused regression coverage in `test_nixl_backend_basic.py`; #34692 currently changes `conn.py` only, with its test kept on a separate fork branch as noted in that PR.\n\nCould the maintainers advise which PR should continue? I’m happy to consolidate the work or close this one if another direction is preferred.",
      "created_at": "2026-08-13T07:47:29Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34688#issuecomment-5277542944",
      "id": 5277542944,
      "updated_at": "2026-08-13T07:47:29Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "ting-hong-shieh"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "Closing in favor of #34692, now merged as `a82f8e177`.\n\nI also compared the test-only rewrite I had prepared with [the public `rfc-pd-test` branch at `ca7ad0f50`](https://github.com/jambow0320/sglang/blob/ca7ad0f50f24f35dbc89e77637a01631197cab61/test/registered/unit/disaggregation/rfc-test/test_nixl_sender_bootstrap_timeout.py). That test constructs a real `NixlKVManager` and covers the sender's `init_time`, the timeout transition to `KVPoll.Failed`, `request_status`, and the recorded failure reason. My rewrite covers the same scenario with mocks, so pushing it would duplicate already published work.\n\nNo branch update was made after #34692 merged. Thanks to @jambow0320 and @ShangmingCai for carrying the fix through.",
      "created_at": "2026-08-13T23:15:53Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34688#issuecomment-5287456094",
      "id": 5287456094,
      "updated_at": "2026-08-13T23:15:53Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "ting-hong-shieh"
      }
    }
